{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"按已审稿的独立技术单元和双文档结构保存可读研究内容","content_hash":"e83c0e1cf53178737f3106666d072bae61a87d9407975e564da50c698fff2396","created_at":"2026-09-09T06:32:34.154111Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-approved-v3-report-author","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","顺序敏感","补偿","有限构造输入"],"kind":"document_section","level":null,"owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"c9ab320069397e5219eca068d85e33fd7636368db676026a7f9d3f1f68863c20","target_id":"MEM-c52df8fb-ca9e-53a7-a49b-342592884a50","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"f622c9730e82aa63f77c098592809f4aef8b601cfe747931c42974de741ad9cd","target_id":"MEM-c4a61c00-1bf1-59b3-a65e-0fa4847db2e1","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"4e863128333d48e4bb228682a3664fbabd1155143bc92db2d6a1d1b50db6cf86","target_id":"MEM-96f79923-f023-509e-a002-40f2d5a4fca1","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"| 构造场景 | 显式逐项累加 | Kahan | Neumaier | math.fsum |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 第一轮：3种顺序 | 1/3 | 未比较 | 未比较 | 3/3 |\n| 第二轮：三项输入全部6种排列 | 2/6 | 2/6 | 6/6 | 6/6 |\n| 第三轮：30项输入的30种排列 | 0/30 | 5/30 | 30/30 | 30/30 |\n\n表中为精确命中数/已测试样本数。逐项累加的最大绝对误差在三轮分别为1000、1和10；Kahan在第二、三轮均出现误差，最大值分别为1和10。Neumaier及math.fsum在其对应已测试输入中均与精确基准一致。\n\n第二轮$[10^{16},1,-10^{16}]$的Kahan轨迹表明：第二步补偿值已记录为$-1$，但第三步修正输入时再次舍入，最终返回0而精确和为1。因此，问题并非“补偿没有发生”，而是这个具体实现与输入中补偿仍可能丢失。该反例也不能推出Kahan在所有场景无效。","type":"prose"}],"missing_refs":[],"role":"experiment","section_key":"brief-results","title":"核心结果","watch_refs":[{"baseline_record_hash":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","baseline_revi